    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397040/extras/fde0eb7bcf0280a0def900fe54436735.poster.avif?t=1754226056\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397040/extras/fde0eb7bcf0280a0def900fe54436735.webm?t=1754226056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397040/extras/fde0eb7bcf0280a0def900fe54436735.mp4?t=1754226056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bellatores is an open-world adventure MMORPG set in the 15th-century medieval era, centered around conflicts between noble houses.<br>Thrilling combat, dynamic action, and the freedom to explore and gather await you. Become the head of a noble house, take charge of its destiny, and embark on a journey toward glory.<br>Amid loyalty and betrayal, war and unity, your decisions may change the course of history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A journey to uncover the kingdom\u2019s hidden truths awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397040/extras/3853fbe30e4690ff944fb0a100300262.webp?t=1754226056\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397040/extras/294bfa4f8afd1ed95c031847dfea2e83.poster.avif?t=1754226056\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397040/extras/294bfa4f8afd1ed95c031847dfea2e83.webm?t=1754226056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397040/extras/294bfa4f8afd1ed95c031847dfea2e83.mp4?t=1754226056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>For the Honor of Your House</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step onto the fierce battlefield as its leader and prove your valor. Through the House System, which determines the fate of five noble houses, you will engage in large-scale warfare and political strife. This is no mere test of strength. It is your chance to forge glory, earn renown, and make your name resound across the world. Your choices will shape the destiny of your House.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397040/extras/476d17c4b84ae720f68fb660292b86d7.webp?t=1754226056\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397040/extras/0fafb8db35a8b4b3f51c9fbb83bcefce.poster.avif?t=1754226056\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397040/extras/0fafb8db35a8b4b3f51c9fbb83bcefce.webm?t=1754226056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397040/extras/0fafb8db35a8b4b3f51c9fbb83bcefce.mp4?t=1754226056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World of Limitless Possibilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your own unique combat style by freely switching between two weapons, with no fixed classes or restrictions. Detailed skill customization enables truly creative and strategic gameplay. In this level-free world, exploit your opponents\u2019 weaknesses with unique combinations and tactical insight. This is more than just gameplay. It\u2019s a journey to craft a fighting style that\u2019s truly your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397040/extras/8260985aed0d8ca9fb2ee1781f357db6.webp?t=1754226056\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397040/extras/9622104e9f4a5af9e1d86deb751065ff.poster.avif?t=1754226056\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397040/extras/9622104e9f4a5af9e1d86deb751065ff.webm?t=1754226056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397040/extras/9622104e9f4a5af9e1d86deb751065ff.mp4?t=1754226056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Power Shines in Unity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with trusted allies to take down powerful enemies in high-difficulty party dungeons and raids. Cooperation and strategy are the keys to victory, and the sense of achievement and joy you\u2019ll feel after overcoming a challenging journey together will be all the greater.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397040/extras/6b4a727a2d2aac803e6f8d5669b210c4.webp?t=1754226056\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397040/extras/8c1d1ad3598978bc5be435ca021eaa81.poster.avif?t=1754226056\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397040/extras/8c1d1ad3598978bc5be435ca021eaa81.webm?t=1754226056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397040/extras/8c1d1ad3598978bc5be435ca021eaa81.mp4?t=1754226056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forge Your Path</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bellatores features a mastery-based progression system that allows every player to forge their own path and enjoy adventure on their own terms. Every activity, whether it\u2019s hunting, gathering, crafting, or trading, offers both meaningful rewards and a sense of purpose. Use the resources you\u2019ve earned through your efforts to shape your own growth and combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397040/extras/018dc4fa8275413441ee08afc0213f3a.webp?t=1754226056\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397040/extras/16bd4efff2eca4776fc139c822963a9b.poster.avif?t=1754226056\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397040/extras/16bd4efff2eca4776fc139c822963a9b.webm?t=1754226056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397040/extras/16bd4efff2eca4776fc139c822963a9b.mp4?t=1754226056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Kingdom\u2019s Fate Trembles at the Edge of the Wall</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fall of the realm is no longer just an old tale. Each noble house now seeks the throne, driven by its own beliefs and ambitions. In this era of chaos, where loyalty and betrayal, war and unity intertwine, what will you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the one who reshapes the fate of the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397040/extras/fde0eb7bcf0280a0def900fe54436735.poster.avif?t=1754226056\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397040/extras/fde0eb7bcf0280a0def900fe54436735.webm?t=1754226056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397040/extras/fde0eb7bcf0280a0def900fe54436735.mp4?t=1754226056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bellatores is an open-world adventure MMORPG set in the 15th-century medieval era, centered around conflicts between noble houses.<br>Thrilling combat, dynamic action, and the freedom to explore and gather await you. Become the head of a noble house, take charge of its destiny, and embark on a journey toward glory.<br>Amid loyalty and betrayal, war and unity, your decisions may change the course of history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A journey to uncover the kingdom\u2019s hidden truths awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397040/extras/3853fbe30e4690ff944fb0a100300262.webp?t=1754226056\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397040/extras/294bfa4f8afd1ed95c031847dfea2e83.poster.avif?t=1754226056\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397040/extras/294bfa4f8afd1ed95c031847dfea2e83.webm?t=1754226056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/